     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W24<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W24\"> </a></td><td>Abacavir/Lamivudine 600/300 mg</td><td>W24; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W25<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W25\"> </a></td><td>Zidovudine/Lamivudine 300/150 mg</td><td>W25; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W26<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W26\"> </a></td><td>Tenofovir/Lamivudine 300/300 mg</td><td>W26; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W27<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W27\"> </a></td><td>Tenofovir/Lamivudine/Efavirenz 300/300/400 mg</td><td>W27; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W28<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W28\"> </a></td><td>Tenofovir/Lamivudine/Dolutegravir 300/300/50 mg, 30 tablets</td><td>W28; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials; the printed column distinguishes the 30-tablet presentation.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W29<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W29\"> </a></td><td>Tenofovir/Lamivudine/Dolutegravir 300/300/50 mg, 90 tablets</td><td>W29; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials; the printed column distinguishes the 90-tablet presentation.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W30<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W30\"> </a></td><td>Tenofovir alafenamide/Lamivudine/Dolutegravir 25/300/50 mg</td><td>W30; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W31<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W31\"> </a></td><td>Tenofovir alafenamide/Emtricitabine/Dolutegravir 25/200/50 mg</td><td>W31; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W32<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W32\"> </a></td><td>Atazanavir/Ritonavir 300/100 mg</td><td>W32; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W33<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W33\"> </a></td><td>Dolutegravir 50 mg</td><td>W33; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W34<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W34\"> </a></td><td>Ritonavir 100 mg</td><td>W34; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W35<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W35\"> </a></td><td>Darunavir 600 mg</td><td>W35; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W36<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W36\"> </a></td><td>Darunavir/Ritonavir 400/50 mg</td><td>W36; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W37<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W37\"> </a></td><td>Cabotegravir 200 mg/mL, 3 mL vial</td><td>W37; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials. The source worksheet places this product in the adult-ARV section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W38<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W38\"> </a></td><td>Lenacapavir 600 mg tablet</td><td>W38; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials. The source worksheet places this product in the adult-ARV section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W39<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W39\"> </a></td><td>Lenacapavir 927 mg/3 mL injection</td><td>W39; category adult-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials. The source worksheet places this product in the adult-ARV section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W40<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W40\"> </a></td><td>Abacavir/Lamivudine/Dolutegravir 60/30/5 mg</td><td>W40; category paediatric-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W41<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W41\"> </a></td><td>Abacavir/Lamivudine 120/60 mg</td><td>W41; category paediatric-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W42<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W42\"> </a></td><td>Zidovudine/Lamivudine 60/30 mg</td><td>W42; category paediatric-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W43<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W43\"> </a></td><td>Dolutegravir 10 mg</td><td>W43; category paediatric-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W44<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W44\"> </a></td><td>Nevirapine 50 mg/5 mL</td><td>W44; category paediatric-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W45<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W45\"> </a></td><td>Lopinavir/Ritonavir 100/25 mg</td><td>W45; category paediatric-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W46<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W46\"> </a></td><td>Darunavir/Ritonavir 120/20 mg</td><td>W46; category paediatric-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W47<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W47\"> </a></td><td>Zidovudine 10 mg/mL</td><td>W47; category paediatric-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W48<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W48\"> </a></td><td>Darunavir 75 mg</td><td>W48; category paediatric-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W49<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W49\"> </a></td><td>Ritonavir 25 mg</td><td>W49; category paediatric-art. Report in packs, bottles or vials.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W50<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W50\"> </a></td><td>Co-trimoxazole 960 mg</td><td>W50; category ctx-prophylaxis. Report in tablets.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W51<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W51\"> </a></td><td>Co-trimoxazole 120 mg</td><td>W51; category ctx-prophylaxis. Report in tablets.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W52<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W52\"> </a></td><td>Isoniazid 100 mg</td><td>W52; category tb-preventive-therapy. Report in kits.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W53<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W53\"> </a></td><td>Isoniazid 300 mg</td><td>W53; category tb-preventive-therapy. Report in kits.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W54<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W54\"> </a></td><td>Isoniazid/Rifapentine 300/300 mg</td><td>W54; category tb-preventive-therapy. Report in kits.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W55<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W55\"> </a></td><td>Rifapentine 150 mg</td><td>W55; category tb-preventive-therapy. Report in kits.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W56<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W56\"> </a></td><td>Acyclovir 200 mg tablet</td><td>W56; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W57<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W57\"> </a></td><td>Clotrimazole 100 mg vaginal tablet</td><td>W57; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W58<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W58\"> </a></td><td>Fluconazole 100 mg</td><td>W58; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W59<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W59\"> </a></td><td>Fluconazole 200 mg</td><td>W59; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W60<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W60\"> </a></td><td>Fluconazole 50 mg/5 mL suspension, 35 mL</td><td>W60; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W61<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W61\"> </a></td><td>Nystatin 100,000 IU/mL suspension</td><td>W61; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W62<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W62\"> </a></td><td>Azithromycin 500 mg capsule</td><td>W62; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W63<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W63\"> </a></td><td>Benzathine penicillin 1 g injection</td><td>W63; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W64<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W64\"> </a></td><td>Ceftriaxone 1 g injection</td><td>W64; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W65<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W65\"> </a></td><td>Ciprofloxacin 500 mg tablet</td><td>W65; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W66<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W66\"> </a></td><td>Doxycycline 100 mg capsule</td><td>W66; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W67<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W67\"> </a></td><td>Erythromycin 500 mg tablet</td><td>W67; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W68<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W68\"> </a></td><td>Metronidazole 400 mg tablet</td><td>W68; category anti-infective. The revised worksheet does not state a common reporting unit for this section.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W69<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W69\"> </a></td><td>Podophyllotoxin 0.5% solution</td><td>W69; category anti-infective. The workbook prints 'Podophyllon toxin'; this display uses the likely intended medicine name while preserving W69 as the source code.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W70<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W70\"> </a></td><td>Amphotericin B 50 mg vial</td><td>W70; category advanced-hiv-disease. Advanced HIV disease or cryptococcal-meningitis treatment product.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">W71<a name=\"ng-hiv-pharmacy-worksheet-medicine-cs-W71\"> </a></td><td>Flucytosine 500 mg tablet</td><td>W71; category advanced-hiv-disease. Advanced HIV disease or cryptococcal-meningitis treatment product.</td></tr></table></div>"
